      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Consistency\nQuorum consensus: N (replicas), \nW (write quorum), R (read quorum)\nW + R > N → strong consistency tradeoff\nInconsistency Resolution\nVector clocks",
      "fontSize": 20,
